+# Plan
+
+## Constraints
+- Follow `docs/design.md`; keep the layering (domain has no application imports).
+- Reuse `new_id` from `pharma_agent.domain.shared.ids`; no new id scheme.
+- Each task is test first (see it fail), then code; the code works after every task.
+- No `error` event, `PERSIST_FAILED` code or message may remain at the end.
+- Run commands from `backend/` (`uv run pytest`).
+
+## Task 1: build_turn_messages takes ids
+- Files: `src/pharma_agent/domain/conversation/turns.py`; call sites `application/chat/service.py` (temporary `new_id()` there);
+  tests `tests/domain/test_conversation.py`, `tests/application/test_feedback_service.py` (updated callers).
+- Interfaces: provides required kwargs `user_message_id`, `assistant_message_id`.
+- Test: `test_build_turn_messages_and_pair_turns` asserts the stored messages carry the given ids.
+
+## Task 2: session ids, events and result fields; drop error event
+- Files: `application/chat/service.py`, `application/progress.py`, `domain/agent/run.py`, `backend/README.md`;
+  tests `tests/application/test_chat_service.py`.
+- Interfaces: uses Task 1 kwargs; provides `ChatSession.user_message_id/assistant_message_id`, extended events,
+  `ChatTurnResult` fields.
+- Tests: ids distinct and read-only; first event `message_id`; `done` fields; `created_at` equals stored message;
+  persist failure test rewritten (done last, persisted False, message_id None, no error event, no `ERROR` in `EventType`).
+
+## Task 3: CLI warning
